  "details": "If you have many groups or if their messages in an unknown language sometimes you can forget what group the notification came from. Even though notifications tend to have group's names and pictures, I think it would be good if in addition to buttons \"Acknowledge and dismiss\" and \"Unsubscribe...\" there also would be \"View group\" (like in the event in the calendar). That could also help to quickly find needed group instance if that was the topic of the announcement.",
